;; world/rooms/glasswood/x-4y3.room
(room
  region: glasswood
  at: (-4 3)
  title: "Crown Gap"
  intent: "a gap between two crowns taken at a run; miss, and you drop onto the frozen tarn"
  bed: (wind 0.8 water 0.1 hum 0.1 drone 0.3)
  grid:
  ("     |             |     "
   "     |             |     "
   "     |             |     "
   "     |             |     "
   "     |             |     "
   "     |             |     "
   "===========   ==========#"
   "     |             |    #"
   "     |             |    #"
   "     |             |    #"
   "     |             |    #")
  decor: auto)
;; Two crowns of glazed branches (row 6) with a gap of three (columns
;; 11-13) between them: the envelope's edge, taken at a run from either
;; side. Under both is the Frozen Tarn (x-4y4): a miss, or a drop through
;; the branches, lands you on the ice. The far side is also reached up the
;; frozen fall, so the gap is proved on its own in a probe world cut from
;; the Crowns and this room (the Session Log).
